  "pack_markdown": "# Backseat Alibi — Interaction Wireframe Pack v0.3\nFun promise: 달리는 경로 자체가 알리바이 증거가 되어 경로 판단과 증언 정리가 서로 압박한다.\nCoverage: Briefing → Driving ↔ Alibi Board → Checkpoint ×3 → Escape → Success, with pursuit/fuel Failure, Pause, Retry and Case Select.\nCore: S2 Driving, S3 Alibi Board, S4 Checkpoint. Board uses drag semantics from memory_cards to visited_timeline; other actions retain explicit human-readable contracts. Five case tiers vary branching/risk, memory errors, compound constraints, 2→3 questions and fuel margin without new core rules.",
